  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}! I''m heading out!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641771
    - rid: 1790118603885641774
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} doesn''t respond to Monika.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641775
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Remember to eat breakfast-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641776
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if you don't feel like it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641777
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, all I've got do is follow those signs that led to Ivarstead, except
      make the turn Sayori and Yuri did.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641778
    - rid: 1790118603885641779
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Boy, am I glad that I was made to be the athletic type...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555892
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Prez, is that you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555894
    - rid: 1790118649019236430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Where's {mc}, weren't you two traveling together?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555895
    - rid: 1790118634811555897
    - rid: 1790118634811555898
    - rid: 1790118634811555899
    - rid: 1790118634811555900
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, he's... resting back in Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555901
    - rid: 1790118634811555902
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Why'd you say that with such a weird inflection-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555903
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you have any, uh, urgent Companions business that needs dealing with
      right away?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Other than letting everyone know about the leadership change that doesn't
      impact them that much?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Not really, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555906
    - rid: 1790118634811555909
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Great. You mind coming with me to go get Sayori and Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555907
    - rid: 1790118634811555908
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What, you bored and want to have a proper club meeting again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555910
    - rid: 1790118634811555911
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555912
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Something like that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You should be fine, so long as you can return to Jorrvaskr before the
      sun sets for the day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555913
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't think we'll be occupied for that long.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555914
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Then sure, you guys can head back without me for now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555915
    - rid: 1790118634811555916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The three Companions take their leave, marching toward the yellowed plains
      of Whiterun.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118634811555917
    - rid: 1790118634811555918
    - rid: 1790118634811555919
    - rid: 1790118634811555920
    - rid: 1790118634811555923
    - rid: 1790118634811555924
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236352
    - rid: 1790118649019236431
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey Natsuki, where'd you get that axe?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236353
    - rid: 1790118649019236406
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's got quite the design...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236408
    - rid: 1790118649019236409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What? This bad boy?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236410
    - rid: 1790118649019236411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: This is Wuuthrad- once held by the founder of the Companions, now reforged
      to be wielded by my hand!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'That''s... '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236413
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You seem to be having too much fun with this.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236414
    - rid: 1790118649019236415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You're just jealous 'cause you don't have an ancient artifact of your
      own.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236416
    - rid: 1790118649019236417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Whatever you say, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236418
    - rid: 1790118649019236419
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236420
    - rid: 1790118649019236421
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: Cross the bridge at your own peril! The way is dangerous, and the gate
      will not open. You shall not gain entry!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236422
    - rid: 1790118649019236423
    - rid: 1790118649019236425
    - rid: 1790118649019236426
    - rid: 1790118649019236427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fine, are Sayori and Yuri here? We're their friends.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236428
    - rid: 1790118649019236429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I take it you want to speak with them?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236434
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236432
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: Before I get them, who are you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: My name's Monika, and she's Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: I see.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Faralda heads into the college, the two girls assuming she's going to
      get Sayori and Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You think they've learned any cool magic tricks?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236436
    - rid: 1790118649019236437
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236438
    - rid: 1790118649019236439
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But I feel like calling it a magic "trick" wouldn't be accurate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236441
    - rid: 1790118649019236443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Since, you know, <i>it's real</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236442
    - rid: 1790118649019236444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7d90acd337545242978d965e5b6e6f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heeeeey!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236445
    - rid: 1790118649019236446
    - rid: 1790118649019236447
    - rid: 1790118649019236448
    - rid: 1790118649019236449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Oof</NoiseText>-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236450
    - rid: 1790118649019236451
    - rid: 1790118649019236452
    - rid: 1790118649019236453
    - rid: 1790118649019236454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm so happy to see you guys!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236456
    - rid: 1790118649019236457
    - rid: 1790118649019236458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How long <i>has</i> it been since we last saw each other, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236459
    - rid: 1790118649019236461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Long enough for you to forget I don't like surprise hugs, apparently.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236462
    - rid: 1790118649019236463
    - rid: 1790118649019236464
    - rid: 1790118649019236466
    - rid: 1790118649019236467
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236468
    - rid: 1790118649019236469
    - rid: 1790118649019236470
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What about you, Yuri? You forget how to be a functional person too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236478
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236471
    - rid: 1790118649019236472
    - rid: 1790118649019236473
    - rid: 1790118649019236479
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahh... the gang's all here!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236475
    - rid: 1790118649019236476
    - rid: 1790118649019236477
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236474
    - rid: 1790118649019236480
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Where's {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236481
    - rid: 1790118649019236482
    - rid: 1790118649019236483
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's the reason I came to get you guys.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236484
    - rid: 1790118649019236485
    - rid: 1790118649019236486
    - rid: 1790118649019236487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: A bunch of things have happened, and {mc} would like to talk with everyone
      about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236488
    - rid: 1790118649019236489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Does this have something to do with that main quest stuff the two of
      you were doing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236491
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Not directly, I don't think.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is he alright? Why couldn't he come with you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236493
    - rid: 1790118649019236495
    - rid: 1790118649019236496
    - rid: 1790118649019236497
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He's just resting- right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236498
    - rid: 1790118649019236499
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... he's safe, if that's what you're worried about.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236500
    - rid: 1790118649019236502
    - rid: 1790118649019236503
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236501
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, time's-a-wasting!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236504
    - rid: 1790118649019236507
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}''s in Riverwood, so that''s where we''re heading.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236505
    - rid: 1790118649019236506
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Finally, some place warmer...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236508
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236509
    - rid: 1790118649019236510
    - rid: 1790118649019236511
    - rid: 1790118649019236512
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '... Get this: those jerks slammed me into the basin, which caused the
      blood to fall in my mouth.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236513
    - rid: 1790118649019236514
    - rid: 1790118649019236515
    - rid: 1790118649019236516
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So then I was a werewolf, even though I didn't want to be.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236517
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that explains the ears.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236518
    - rid: 1790118649019236519
    - rid: 1790118649019236521
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What, you think I'd murder some pink wolf just to wear its ears on my
      head?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236520
    - rid: 1790118649019236522
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, maybe not the wolf murder part-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236524
    - rid: 1790118649019236527
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: But I thought it might've just been a fashion statement.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236523
    - rid: 1790118649019236525
    - rid: 1790118649019236528
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh <i>puh</i>-lease, I'm out here fighting bears, zombies, and wolf-spirits;
      I don't exactly have the time to be worried about my appearance.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236529
    - rid: 1790118649019236530
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: You certainly smell like it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236531
    - rid: 1790118649019236532
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236533
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? You're telling me it was all sunshine and roses up in your stone
      towers, getting your magicians' license or whatever?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236534
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Not exactly, we've faced our fair share of draugr, too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236535
    - rid: 1790118649019236536
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm still not entirely sure why Mr. Tolfdir had us go deeper into Saarthal...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236537
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236538
    - rid: 1790118649019236539
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Then, Mr. Aren quite literally sacrificed himself so that Morokei
      would be weakened enough for us to defeat him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236540
    - rid: 1790118649019236541
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah gee, that's rough...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236542
    - rid: 1790118649019236543
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, at least it worked out in the end for you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236544
    - rid: 1790118649019236545
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Kodlak just died in battle, before we could cure him of being a werewolf.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236546
    - rid: 1790118649019236547
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236548
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Luckily, we could still cure him after he died.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236549
    - rid: 1790118649019236550
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... How does that work? Being cured of a disease after death doesn't
      make much sense.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236551
    - rid: 1790118649019236552
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's 'cause lycanthropy isn't really a disease, it's something
      that happens to your soul-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236553
    - rid: 1790118649019236554
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
